{"3636700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DozTroy", "steam_appid": 3636700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNWIND AT ANY TIME</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At work with 5 minutes to kill during your coffee break?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting the week with a boring videoconference?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggling to get through that document?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let off some steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/adc73f18f8dbe29db179fa78a2429fa1.poster.avif?t=1759743187\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/adc73f18f8dbe29db179fa78a2429fa1.webm?t=1759743187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK MULTIPLE WEAPONS AND TOOLS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a wide array of weapons, from pistols to miniguns, as well as rifles, lasers, flamethrowers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tools like a screwdriver, stamp, marker, and redecorate your office.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons and tools added with every update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/2b5f76b4930aeed5dd1681c4f5821da3.poster.avif?t=1759743187\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/2b5f76b4930aeed5dd1681c4f5821da3.webm?t=1759743187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFERENT GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to reach the highest score or survive as long as possible by fighting off ducks, zombies, mosquitos, and other creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/3732a834dad9bf15cf9a1cca766b1499.poster.avif?t=1759743187\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/3732a834dad9bf15cf9a1cca766b1499.webm?t=1759743187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Play with two players on the same screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick launcher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Boss panic&quot; key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNWIND AT ANY TIME</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At work with 5 minutes to kill during your coffee break?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting the week with a boring videoconference?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggling to get through that document?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let off some steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/adc73f18f8dbe29db179fa78a2429fa1.poster.avif?t=1759743187\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/adc73f18f8dbe29db179fa78a2429fa1.webm?t=1759743187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK MULTIPLE WEAPONS AND TOOLS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a wide array of weapons, from pistols to miniguns, as well as rifles, lasers, flamethrowers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tools like a screwdriver, stamp, marker, and redecorate your office.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons and tools added with every update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/2b5f76b4930aeed5dd1681c4f5821da3.poster.avif?t=1759743187\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/2b5f76b4930aeed5dd1681c4f5821da3.webm?t=1759743187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFERENT GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to reach the highest score or survive as long as possible by fighting off ducks, zombies, mosquitos, and other creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/3732a834dad9bf15cf9a1cca766b1499.poster.avif?t=1759743187\" width=616 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636700/extras/3732a834dad9bf15cf9a1cca766b1499.webm?t=1759743187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: Play with two players on the same screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick launcher.